{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"liuliao-e-o078","title":"延请精兵出子午计亮不用","accounts":[{"id":"liuliao-a-7312ede68cdcfa0b2e36","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"延请精兵出子午计亮不用","evidence":["liuliao-q-bd25c46a5e8b41aeff3d"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0091","role":"提出子午计","evidence":["liuliao-q-bd25c46a5e8b41aeff3d"]},{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"以悬危不采用","evidence":["liuliao-q-bd25c46a5e8b41aeff3d"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liuliao-q-bd25c46a5e8b41aeff3d"]},"ordering_evidence":"liuliao-q-bd25c46a5e8b41aeff3d","source_order":[40,290,10],"order":7307}],"persons":[{"id":"xianzhu-p0091","name":"魏延","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liuliao-q-bd25c46a5e8b41aeff3d","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-5b0651b11b2085bc11d1","layer":"pei","quote":"夏侯楙为安西将军，镇长安。亮于南郑与群下计议，延曰：‘闻夏侯楙少，主婿也；怯而无谋。今假延精兵五千，负粮五千；直从褒中出，循秦岭而东，当子午而北：不过十日，可到长安。楙闻延奄至，必乘船逃走；长安中，惟有御史、京兆太守耳。横门邸阁与散民之谷，足周食也。比东方相合聚，尚二十许日；而公从斜谷来，必足以达。如此，则一举而咸阳以西可定矣！’亮以为此悬危；不如安从坦道，可以平取陇右，十全必克而无虞。故不用延计","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":289,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-634d3c9aa56fe2f2b975","start":10,"end":210,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
